      "contact_id": "agxzfnViZXItdm9pY2VyFAsSB0NvbnRhY3QYgMCS7OGH2wsM",
      "content": "Hey, I'm doing good. How about you?",
      "name": "Sumit Patel",
      "time": "2026-09-26T18:40:47.956571",
      "type": "transcript"
    },
    {
      "content": "I'm doing well, thank you for asking, sir. I noticed that we had given you a call earlier today. I was just, I guess curious if you guys had covered anything in terms of the quote process or what that kinda looks like.",
      "name": "Erik Orama",
      "time": "2026-09-26T18:40:49.306051",
