      "user_id": "4824582189268992"
    },
    {
      "contact_id": "agxzfnViZXItdm9pY2VyFAsSB0NvbnRhY3QYgMCS7OGH2wsM",
      "content": "I think I was supposed to get a quote from you guys. But I haven't received it. I don't know if they sent it out or not? But yeah, it was, yeah, I talked to somebody. Right? Just about, I would say an hour back and, yeah, the quote, I can't remember what they quoted me. But it was, it was for a one bedroom furniture and needed to have it moved from one house to another house.",
      "name": "Sumit Patel",
