      "time": "2026-09-26T18:41:38.356571",
      "type": "transcript"
    },
    {
      "content": "Okay, so it looks like Zachary was who called you or Zach. I can reach out to him and see if he knows kind of what's going on. We just, we have your profile kind of sitting in our open inquiry lead section and so I just was, was giving you a call to see if we, if we could get an estimate over to you but if you guys already had that conversation then I'll see kind of where he's at on things and see if we can get that emailed to you.",
