    {
      "contact_id": "agxzfnViZXItdm9pY2VyFAsSB0NvbnRhY3QYgMCS7OGH2wsM",
      "content": "Does your, does your, there's your prices depend on, like, is it, would it be cheaper if it's on weekdays rather than on weekends? Does your price. Okay, because if that's the case then I'm also flexible for like twenty first twenty second or twenty third you know, for, for better pricing.",
