      "user_id": "4824582189268992"
    },
    {
      "content": "Okay. Let's see here. So twenty first is training day we could do something on the twenty second that Thursday? And then our weekend pricing is a little strange cause it's technically, you know, the weekend is Saturday and Sunday, but for us, our weekend prices are on Fridays and Saturdays cause those are the busiest days. So the Sunday through Thursday, timeframe is gonna save you about $6 per person per hour on the hourly rate.",
