      "contact_id": "agxzfnViZXItdm9pY2VyFAsSB0NvbnRhY3QYgMCS7OGH2wsM",
      "content": "Oh, okay. Yeah, so it's like, if twenty first, oh, you know what I mean? You have a training on twenty first twenty second is cheaper than I can also do that date. So, yeah.",
